<view class="page" a:if="{{o.id}}">

  <!-- 顶部状态区：直接铺在页面背景上，不套卡片——它是这一页的标题而不是内容 -->
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-status">{{o._statusText}}</view>
    <view class="hero-sub-row">
      <text class="hero-sub">{{o._statusSub}}</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 五段进度：10 种订单状态收敛到 5 步（见 js 的 STATUS_STEP） -->
    <view a:if="{{o._stepIndex >= 0}}" class="steps">
      <view class="steps-track">
        <block a:for="{{steps}}" a:key="*this">
          <view class="step-seg">
            <view class="step-bar {{index <= o._stepIndex ? 'on' : ''}}"></view>
            <view class="step-dot {{index < o._stepIndex ? 'done' : (index === o._stepIndex ? 'cur' : '')}}"></view>
          </view>
        </block>
      </view>
      <view class="steps-labels">
        <block a:for="{{steps}}" a:key="*this">
          <text class="step-label {{index === o._stepIndex ? 'on' : ''}}">{{item}}</text>
        </block>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 主卡片：收货地址 + 商品 + 租期，一张卡讲清"租的什么、寄到哪、租多久" -->
  <view class="card main-card">
    <view a:if="{{o.address_snapshot}}" class="mc-addr">
      <view class="addr-ico"></view>
      <view class="addr-info">
        <view class="addr-full">{{o.address_snapshot.full}}</view>
        <view class="addr-line1">
          <text class="addr-name">{{o.address_snapshot.receiver_name}}</text>
          <text class="addr-phone">{{o.address_snapshot.receiver_phone}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="mc-goods">
      <view a:if="{{o.product_cover}}" class="mc-thumb"><smart-image style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%" src="{{o.product_cover}}" mode="aspectFill" /></view>
      <view a:else class="mc-thumb mc-thumb-ph">{{o._shortName}}</view>
      <view class="mc-gbody">
        <view class="mc-grow1">
          <text class="mc-gname">{{o.product_name}}</text>
          <text class="mc-gqty">x1</text>
        </view>
        <view a:if="{{o.sku_name}}" class="mc-gspec">{{o.sku_name}}</view>
        <view class="mc-gtags">
          <text class="mc-gtag">免赔保障</text>
          <text class="mc-gtag">租期质保</text>
          <text class="mc-gtag">隐私保护</text>
          <text class="mc-gtag">极速审核</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <block a:if="{{o._tl}}">
      <view class="mc-tl-note">快递期间不算租期，起租日以签收日为准</view>
      <!-- 租期条：中间三格浅蓝底 = 计费区间，两端灰格 = 物流收尾 -->
      <view class="tlbar">
        <view class="tlbar-cells">
          <text class="tlbar-cell">签收</text>
          <!-- 计费区间独占一个浅蓝圆角块，不撑满外框高度也不贴边 -->
          <view class="tlbar-hl">
            <text class="tlbar-cell on">起租</text>
            <text class="tlbar-cell on strong">共{{o.days}}天</text>
            <text class="tlbar-cell on">到期</text>
          </view>
          <text class="tlbar-cell">归还</text>
        </view>
        <view class="tlbar-dates">
          <view class="tlbar-dcell">
            <text class="tlbar-date">{{o._tl.receive}}</text>
          </view>
          <!-- ▲ 指回上方的起租/到期格，说明这个日期对应哪个节点 -->
          <view class="tlbar-dcell">
            <view class="tlbar-caret"></view>
            <text class="tlbar-date on">{{o._tl.rentStart}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="tlbar-dcell"></view>
          <view class="tlbar-dcell">
            <view class="tlbar-caret"></view>
            <text class="tlbar-date on">{{o._tl.expire}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="tlbar-dcell">
            <text class="tlbar-date">{{o._tl.giveBack}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <!-- 发货倒计时（仅 status=send 显示） -->
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'send'}}" class="card ship-card">
    <view a:if="{{!o._shipOverdue}}">
      <view class="ship-title">商家承诺 48 小时内发货</view>
      <view class="ship-sub">发货超时将赠送 3 天额外免租期</view>
      <view class="ship-countdown">
        <view class="cd-label">剩余</view>
        <view class="cd-blocks">
          <view class="cd-num">{{o._shipHH}}</view>
          <text class="cd-colon">:</text>
          <view class="cd-num">{{o._shipMM}}</view>
          <text class="cd-colon">:</text>
          <view class="cd-num">{{o._shipSS}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="cd-unit">时 / 分 / 秒</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view a:else class="ship-overdue">
      <view class="ship-overdue-title">发货超时</view>
      <view class="ship-overdue-sub">请联系客服进行催促，我们将为你赠送 3 天额外免租期</view>
      <view class="ship-overdue-btn" onTap="onCallService">
        <view class="ic-phone"></view>
        <text>联系客服电话</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 已付租金 -->
  <view a:if="{{rent.show}}" class="card rent-card">
    <view class="rent-head">
      <text class="rent-title">已付租金</text>
      <text class="rent-state on">已支付</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rent-amount-line">
      <text class="rent-currency">¥</text>
      <text class="rent-num">{{rent.paidAmount}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rent-sub">该金额已在下单授权成功后完成支付</view>

    <view class="rent-info">
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">物流免租期</text>
        <text class="info-v">{{rent.physicalStartText}} 起 · 免租 {{rent.shipDays}} 天</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">起租日（开始计费）</text>
        <text class="info-v hl-primary">{{rent.billingStartText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view a:if="{{rent.endDateText}}" class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">预计归还日</text>
        <text class="info-v">{{rent.endDateText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view a:if="{{rent.overhold}}" class="rent-warn-banner">
      ⚠️ 已超过预计归还日，请尽快安排寄回
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 物流信息（已发货后显示）
       接了顺丰时多一段真实轨迹时间轴；没接 / 非顺丰单则退化成原来的两行 -->
  <view a:if="{{o.logistics_no}}" class="card logi-card">
    <view class="card-h">
      <text class="card-title">物流信息</text>
      <view class="lg-head-right">
        <text a:if="{{o._shippedAtText}}" class="muted-sm">{{o._shippedAtText}} 已发货</text>
        <text a:if="{{logi.supported}}" class="lg-refresh" onTap="onRefreshLogistics">
          {{logi.loading ? '刷新中' : '刷新'}}
        </text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 最新一条：单独放大，用户进页面第一眼要看的就是"现在到哪了" -->
    <view a:if="{{logi.latest}}" class="lg-latest">
      <view class="lg-latest-top">
        <text class="lg-badge {{logi.latest.signed ? 'signed' : ''}}">{{logi.latest.status}}</text>
        <text class="lg-latest-time">{{logi.latest._d}} {{logi.latest._t}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="lg-latest-desc">{{logi.latest.desc}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-k">快递公司</text>
      <text class="info-v">{{o._logiCompanyName}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-k">运单号</text>
      <text class="info-v mono" onTap="onCopyLogisticsNo">{{o.logistics_no}}<text class="copy-hint"> 复制</text></text>
    </view>

    <!-- 全部轨迹：默认收起，展开后是自上而下的时间轴（最新在最上） -->
    <block a:if="{{logi.supported && logi.routes.length}}">
      <view class="lg-toggle" onTap="toggleLogi">
        <text>{{logi.expanded ? '收起物流详情' : '查看全部物流（' + logi.routes.length + ' 条）'}}</text>
        <text class="lg-arrow {{logi.expanded ? 'up' : ''}}">›</text>
      </view>

      <view a:if="{{logi.expanded}}" class="lg-timeline">
        <view a:for="{{logi.routes}}" a:for-item="r" a:key="time"
              class="lg-node {{index === 0 ? 'first' : ''}} {{r.signed ? 'signed' : ''}}">
          <view class="lg-axis">
            <view class="lg-dot"></view>
            <view a:if="{{index !== logi.routes.length - 1}}" class="lg-line"></view>
          </view>
          <view class="lg-body">
            <view class="lg-node-top">
              <text class="lg-node-status">{{r.status}}</text>
              <text class="lg-node-time">{{r._d}} {{r._t}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="lg-node-desc">{{r.desc}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <!-- 拉不到轨迹时只提示一句，不影响上面的运单号展示 -->
    <view a:if="{{logi.loaded && logi.supported && !logi.routes.length}}" class="lg-empty">
      {{logi.error || '暂无物流轨迹，快递员揽收后即可查看'}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 续租直接在订单详情内完成，逾期订单不允许续租 -->
  <view a:if="{{renewal.show}}" class="card renewal-card">
    <view class="rn-head">
      <view>
        <view class="renewal-entry-title">续租</view>
        <view class="renewal-entry-sub">当前归还日 {{o.end_date}}，按原订单计价标准结算</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="rn-options">
      <view a:for="{{renewal.options}}" a:key="days"
            class="rn-opt {{!renewal.custom && renewal.selected === item.days ? 'on' : ''}} {{item.disabled ? 'disabled' : ''}}"
            data-days="{{item.days}}" onTap="onRenewalPreset">{{item.days}}天</view>
      <picker mode="date" value="{{renewal.customDate}}" start="{{renewal.minDate}}"
              end="{{renewal.maxDate}}" disabled="{{renewal.maxExtendDays < 1}}" onChange="onRenewalDateChange">
        <view class="rn-opt {{renewal.custom ? 'on' : ''}}" onTap="onRenewalCustomTap">自定义</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view a:if="{{renewal.unavailableMsg}}" class="rn-limit-warn">{{renewal.unavailableMsg}}</view>
    <view a:else class="rn-limit-tip">单次最多 60 天，最晚归还日 {{renewal.maxDate}}（押金授权到期前 10 天）</view>
    <view a:if="{{renewal.custom}}" class="rn-custom-date">新归还日：{{renewal.customDate}}</view>
    <view class="rn-quote">
      <view>
        <view class="rn-price-label">续租价格</view>
        <view a:if="{{renewal.quoting}}" class="rn-loading">计算中…</view>
        <view a:elif="{{renewal.quote}}" class="rn-price">¥{{renewal.quote.quoted_amount_text}}</view>
        <view a:else class="rn-loading">请选择续租时长</view>
      </view>
      <view class="rn-pay {{(!renewal.quote || renewal.paying) ? 'disabled' : ''}}" onTap="onRenewalPay">
        {{renewal.paying ? '处理中…' : '确认续租'}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 寄回归还表单（using/return/overdue 显示）-->
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'using' || o.status === 'return' || o.status === 'overdue'}}" class="card return-ship-form">
    <view class="card-h">
      <text class="card-title">寄回归还</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rs-sub">填写寄回快递信息，商家收到并核验通过后自动解冻押金</view>
    <view a:if="{{o.return_reject_reason}}" class="rs-reject">
      <text class="rs-reject-tag">上次驳回</text>
      <text class="rs-reject-text">{{o.return_reject_reason}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="rs-field">
      <view class="rs-field-label">快递公司</view>
      <view class="rs-segments">
        <view a:for="{{couriers}}" a:for-item="c" a:key="code"
              class="rs-seg {{rsCompany === c.code ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-code="{{c.code}}" onTap="onRsCompany">
          <view class="rs-seg-dot"></view>
          <text class="rs-seg-name">{{c.name}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="rs-field">
      <view class="rs-field-label">
        运单号
        <text a:if="{{rsNo}}" class="rs-field-hint">{{rsNo.length}} 位</text>
      </view>
      <view class="rs-input-wrap {{rsNo ? 'has-value' : ''}}">
        <view class="rs-input-ico"></view>
        <input class="rs-input" value="{{rsNo}}" placeholder="粘贴或输入运单号"
               onInput="onRsNoInput" />
        <view a:if="{{rsNo}}" class="rs-input-clear" catchTap="onClearRsNo">×</view>
        <view a:else class="rs-input-paste" catchTap="onPasteRsNo">粘贴</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="rs-submit {{(!rsCompany || !rsNo || rsSubmitting) ? 'disabled' : ''}}"
          onTap="onSubmitReturn">{{rsSubmitting ? '提交中…' : '提交寄回信息'}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 已寄回，等待商家签收核验（status === return_inspecting）-->
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'return_inspecting'}}" class="card return-pending-card">
    <view class="rp-badge">
      <view class="rp-badge-dot"></view>
      <text class="rp-badge-text">待商家签收</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rp-title">等待商家收货核验</view>
    <view class="rp-sub">已收到你的寄回信息，商家签收并核验通过后将自动解冻押金</view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-k">快递公司</text>
      <text class="info-v">{{o.return_logistics_company_name || o.return_logistics_company}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-k">运单号</text>
      <text class="info-v mono">{{o.return_logistics_no}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 已归还后的"我要评价"入口（评价归属商品，跳到商品详情后自动弹评价层） -->
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'done'}}" class="card review-cta-card" onTap="onGoReview">
    <view class="rcta-left">
      <view class="rcta-ico">★</view>
      <view class="rcta-text">
        <view class="rcta-title">订单已完成，写下你的评价</view>
        <view class="rcta-sub">分享真实体验，帮助其他用户做决定</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="rcta-arrow">›</text>
  </view>

  <!-- 押金信息 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-h">
      <view class="deposit-title-wrap">
        <text class="card-title">押金信息</text>
        <view class="deposit-help" onTap="onDepositHelp">!</view>
      </view>
      <image class="zmxy-badge" src="/images/zmxy-badge.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-k">实付押金</text>
      <text class="info-v deposit-amt">¥0.00</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-k">冻结金额</text>
      <text class="info-v">¥{{o._freezeText}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 历史扣款记录（押金里被扣过的真实流水） -->
  <view a:if="{{charges.length}}" class="card charges-card">
    <view class="card-h">
      <text class="card-title">扣款记录</text>
      <text class="charge-total">合计 ¥{{chargeTotalText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view a:for="{{charges}}" a:for-item="t" a:key="id" class="charge-item">
      <view class="charge-row1">
        <text class="charge-tag">{{t.reason_label}}</text>
        <text class="charge-amount">¥{{t.amount_text}}</text>
      </view>
      <view a:if="{{t.reason_detail}}" class="charge-detail">{{t.reason_detail}}</view>
      <view class="charge-time">{{t.paid_at_text}}</view>

      <!-- 退款入口 / 退款状态行 -->
      <!-- ① 未申请且仍有可退金额 → 黄字"对此扣款有疑问？"按钮 -->
      <view
        a:if="{{(t.refund_apply.status === '' || t.refund_apply.status === 'REJECTED') && t.refundable_amount > 0}}"
        class="charge-refund-entry"
        data-id="{{t.id}}"
        onTap="onOpenRefundApply">
        <text class="charge-refund-link">对此扣款有疑问？申请退款 ›</text>
      </view>
      <!-- ② 审核中 -->
      <view a:if="{{t.refund_apply.status === 'PENDING'}}" class="charge-refund-state pending">
        <text class="rs-dot"></text>
        <text class="rs-text">退款审核中 · 2 个工作日内处理</text>
      </view>
      <!-- ③ 已驳回（驳回理由 + 仍可重新申请的按钮已经在 ① 显示了，这里只展示历史） -->
      <view a:if="{{t.refund_apply.status === 'REJECTED'}}" class="charge-refund-state rejected">
        <text class="rs-text">上次退款申请已被驳回</text>
        <text a:if="{{t.refund_apply.rejected_reason}}" class="rs-sub">理由：{{t.refund_apply.rejected_reason}}</text>
      </view>
      <!-- ④ 已退款（成功） -->
      <view a:if="{{t.refunded_amount > 0}}" class="charge-refund-state done">
        <text class="rs-text">已退款 ¥{{t.refunded_amount}}</text>
        <text a:if="{{t.refundable_amount <= 0}}" class="rs-sub">全额退款，原路退回支付宝</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="charge-tip">每笔扣款会同步在你的支付宝账单中显示。如有疑问可申请退款，2 个工作日内审核。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 订单信息：编号常驻可复制，其余明细默认折叠——大多数人来这页只看状态和物流 -->
  <view class="card info-card">
    <view class="oid-row">
      <text class="oid-k">订单编号</text>
      <text class="oid-v mono">{{o.id}}</text>
      <text class="oid-copy" onTap="onCopyOrderId">复制</text>
    </view>

    <block a:if="{{infoOpen}}">
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">总租金</text>
        <text class="info-v">¥{{o._originalText || o._amountText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view a:if="{{o.user_coupon_id}}" class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">优惠券</text>
        <text class="info-v cut">- ¥{{o._discountText}}（{{o.coupon_name}}）</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">实付租金</text>
        <text class="info-v strong">¥{{o._amountText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">租赁天数</text>
        <text class="info-v">{{o.days}} 天</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">每日租金</text>
        <text class="info-v">¥{{o._dailyText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">收货方式</text>
        <text class="info-v">邮寄</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">下单时间</text>
        <text class="info-v">{{o._createdText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view a:if="{{o.user_remark}}" class="info-row">
        <text class="info-k">订单备注</text>
        <text class="info-v">{{o.user_remark}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="info-more" onTap="toggleInfo">
      <text class="info-more-t">{{infoOpen ? '收起' : '展开更多'}}</text>
      <view class="info-more-arr {{infoOpen ? 'up' : ''}}"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 平台保障：静态服务承诺，给用户"敢租"的底气 -->
  <view class="card guard-card">
    <view class="card-h">
      <text class="card-title">平台保障 · 敢租敢赔</text>
      <text class="guard-more" onTap="onOpenAgreement">服务条款 ›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="guard-item">
      <view class="guard-ico"></view>
      <view class="guard-body">
        <view class="guard-t">小伤免赔</view>
        <view class="guard-s">正常使用产生的轻微磨损不计入定损</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="guard-item">
      <view class="guard-ico"></view>
      <view class="guard-body">
        <view class="guard-t">隐私保护</view>
        <view class="guard-s">归还后设备数据全量清除，不留痕</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="guard-item">
      <view class="guard-ico"></view>
      <view class="guard-body">
        <view class="guard-t">押金原路解冻</view>
        <view class="guard-s">核验通过后自动解冻，无需人工申请</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 取消审核中提示（status === pending_cancel）
       两段语义：
         a) 商家还没审核              → 标题"取消申请审核中"
         b) 商家已同意、解冻请求已下发  → 标题"商家已同意，解冻中"
       通过 unfreeze_dispatched_at 区分 -->
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'pending_cancel'}}" class="card cancel-pending-card">
    <block a:if="{{o.unfreeze_dispatched_at}}">
      <view class="cp-title">✅ 商家已同意，解冻中</view>
      <view class="cp-sub">解冻请求已下发，等待支付宝确认；通常几秒到几十秒内完成，订单将自动变为已取消。</view>
    </block>
    <block a:else>
      <view class="cp-title">⏳ 取消申请审核中</view>
      <view class="cp-sub">商家正在核实你的取消申请；通过后将自动解冻信用额度。</view>
    </block>
    <view a:if="{{o.cancel_reason}}" class="cp-reason">理由：{{o.cancel_reason}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 若商家驳回过取消申请，把驳回理由附上来给用户看 -->
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'send' && o.cancel_reject_reason}}" class="card cancel-reject-card">
    <view class="crj-title">取消申请已被商家驳回</view>
    <view class="crj-sub">理由：{{o.cancel_reject_reason}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 给底部固定 Bar 留位 -->
  <view style="height: {{(o.status === 'send' || o.status === 'audit' || o.status === 'pay') ? 200 : 40}}rpx;"></view>

  <!-- 底部固定 Bar：次要动作用描边胶囊，主动作用实心蓝，与全站按钮语言一致 -->
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'send'}}" class="bottom-bar safe-bottom">
    <view class="bb-ghost" onTap="onCallService">联系客服</view>
    <view class="bb-ghost" onTap="onRequestCancel">申请取消</view>
    <view class="bb-primary disabled">等待商家发货</view>
  </view>
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'audit'}}" class="bottom-bar safe-bottom">
    <view class="bb-ghost" onTap="onCallService">联系客服</view>
    <view class="bb-ghost" onTap="onCancel">取消订单</view>
    <view class="bb-primary {{freezing ? 'disabled' : ''}}" onTap="onCreditFreeze">
      {{freezing ? '拉起支付…' : '去免押'}}
    </view>
  </view>
  <view a:if="{{o.status === 'pay'}}" class="bottom-bar safe-bottom">
    <view class="bb-ghost" onTap="onCallService">联系客服</view>
    <view class="bb-ghost" onTap="onCancel">取消订单</view>
    <view class="bb-primary {{payingRent ? 'disabled' : ''}}" onTap="onRentPay">
      <block a:if="{{payingRent}}">拉起支付…</block>
      <block a:else>支付租金 ¥{{o._amountText}}</block>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
